---

## 1. Introduction
This test strategy addresses the validation of Jira API authentication and error handling for missing or inaccessible issue descriptions, as outlined in Issue AD-488. The plan is constrained by the absence of detailed business requirements due to Jira API access errors.

---

## 2. Objectives
- Validate Jira API authentication and access permissions.
- Verify error handling for missing or inaccessible issue descriptions.

---

## 3. Scope

### 3.1 In Scope
- Jira API authentication validation
- Error handling for unauthorized access

### 3.2 Out of Scope
- Functional testing of AD-488 requirements (requirements not available)

---

