### 4.6 Test Environments
- Test environment with Jira API integration configured using valid and invalid authentication tokens
- Mock/stub service or controllable API gateway to simulate 401 Unauthorized responses and null/missing issue description payloads
- Test accounts matrix covering authorized user, unauthorized user, expired-token user, and permission-restricted user profiles
- Application logging/monitoring access to verify captured API failure details without exposing sensitive credentials

#### Data Availability
Test Type | Data Source | Environment | Data Type | Data Volume | Comments
---|---|---|---|---|---
Functional / Integration | Mock Jira API | QA | Auth tokens, null/missing payloads | Low | Simulate 401, null desc
Security | Mock Jira API | QA | Invalid/expired tokens | Low | Simulate unauthorized access

