## 5. Test Schedule / Milestone
- Test design: 2026-07-15 to 2026-07-16
- Script development: 2026-07-17 to 2026-07-19
- Execution: 2026-07-20 to 2026-07-21
- Reporting: 2026-07-22

---

## 6. Risks & Mitigations
Risk | Impact | Likelihood | Severity | Mitigation
---|---|---|---|---
Jira API authentication failures due to expired/invalid tokens | Test execution blocked | High | High | Pre-generate valid/invalid tokens, automate token refresh
Dynamic changes in Jira API response structure | Test script breakage | Medium | High | Use schema validation, monitor API changelogs
Network instability during test runs | Flaky test results | Medium | Medium | Use tcconfig to simulate/recover from network issues
Unauthorized access errors not handled gracefully | User-facing errors, missed defects | Medium | High | Expand negative test coverage, monitor logs
Missing description payloads not handled | Application crash or poor UX | Medium | High | Add null/missing checks, validate fallback messaging

---

## 7. Assumptions
- Test environments and mock services are available and stable.
- Test accounts with required permissions are provisioned.
- Access to application logs and monitoring is granted.
- No business requirements for AD-488 are available.

